# p11k 简体中文翻译。
#
# msgid 就是源码里的英文原文（英文是默认语言，缺翻译时原样输出）。
# 与 p10k 语义相同的文案沿用 p10k 的说法（Prompt Style / Character Set /
# Restart from the beginning. / …），只把词换成中文。
# 词的风格名（Lean. Classic. Rainbow. Pure. Original. Snazzy. Unicode. ASCII.）
# 保持英文，p10k 用户对这些名字的认知是英文的。
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: p11k\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://github.com/powerlevel11k/p11k/issues\n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-09-12 02:52+0800\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2025-01-01 00:00+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: p11k\n"
"Language-Team: Chinese (Simplified)\n"
"Language: zh_CN\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\n"

# ---- 配置解析 ----
#: crates/p11k-engine/src/config.rs:388
msgid "KDL parse error: "
msgstr "KDL 解析失败: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/config.rs:1132
msgid "`state` needs a name (a positional string)"
msgstr "`state` 需要一个名字（位置字符串）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/config.rs:1150
msgid " needs text (a positional string)"
msgstr " 需要文本（位置字符串）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/config.rs:1206
msgid "unknown config key: "
msgstr "无法识别的配置键: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:116
msgid "cannot read config, falling back to the built-in lean theme: "
msgstr "读取配置失败，回退内置 lean 主题: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:127
msgid ""
"unknown preset, falling back to the built-in lean theme (expected lean/"
"classic/rainbow/pure): "
msgstr "未知预设，回退内置 lean 主题（可选 lean/classic/rainbow/pure）: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:430
msgid "usage: p11k [options]"
msgstr "用法: p11k [选项]"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:431
msgid "       p11k configure"
msgstr "       p11k configure"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:433
msgid "Options:"
msgstr "选项:"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:434
msgid ""
"  --shell <name>   inner shell to proxy: zsh, bash, fish or pwsh (default: "
"$SHELL)"
msgstr ""
"  --shell <名字>   被代理的内部 shell：zsh、bash、fish 或 pwsh（缺省取 "
"$SHELL）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:435
msgid "  --config <path>  KDL theme file (default: the built-in lean theme)"
msgstr "  --config <路径>  KDL 主题文件（缺省用内置 lean 主题）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:436
msgid "  --preset <name>  built-in theme: lean, classic, rainbow or pure"
msgstr "  --preset <名字>  内置主题：lean、classic、rainbow 或 pure"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:437
msgid "  --version        print the version and exit"
msgstr "  --version        打印版本后退出"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:438
msgid "  --help           print this help and exit"
msgstr "  --help           打印本说明后退出"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:440
msgid "Commands:"
msgstr "子命令:"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:441
msgid "  configure        interactive theme wizard"
msgstr "  configure        交互式主题向导"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:443
msgid "Environment: P11K_ENGINE guards against recursion; P11K_USER_ZSHRC and"
msgstr "环境变量：P11K_ENGINE 用于防止递归加载；P11K_USER_ZSHRC 与"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:444
msgid "P11K_USER_PROFILE override the rc that gets sourced; P11K_LOCALEDIR"
msgstr "P11K_USER_PROFILE 用于覆盖所 source 的 rc；P11K_LOCALEDIR"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:445
msgid "overrides the translation directory."
msgstr "用于覆盖翻译目录。"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:447
msgid ""
"To use p11k as your theme, add one line to your shell rc — see README.md."
msgstr "若做主题使用，请修改 shell rc，详见 README.zh.md"

# ---- 引擎本体 ----
#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:483
msgid "recursive launch detected (p11k started inside a p11k session)"
msgstr "检测到递归加载（已在 p11k 会话内又启动了 p11k）"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:484
msgid "make sure the bootstrap line in ~/.zshrc is guarded, e.g.:"
msgstr "请确认 ~/.zshrc 里的引导行带判断，例如："

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:488
msgid "cannot exec zsh -f: "
msgstr "exec zsh -f 失败: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:498
msgid "config error: "
msgstr "配置错误: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:502
msgid ""
"every prompt_char state must be the same width (the prompt width is fixed at "
"startup). Fix the config and start p11k again."
msgstr ""
"prompt_char 各态提示符必须等宽（prompt 宽度在启动期固定）。请修改配置后重新启"
"动 p11k。"

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:516
msgid "cannot exec a clean shell: "
msgstr "exec 干净 shell 失败: "

#: crates/p11k-engine/src/main.rs:618
msgid "the inner shell failed to start"
msgstr "内部 shell 没能启动"

